- # `↯/s.105.6` — `Cose.Error`
+ # `↯/s.105.6` — `Cose.Error`

- Raised when a COSE structure is malformed or its signature does not verify.
+ Se lanza cuando una estructura COSE está mal formada o su firma no se verifica.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- COSE — CBOR Object Signing and Encryption — carries signed and encrypted payloads in CBOR.
- This error covers a structure that does not match the specification's shape, an algorithm
- that is not supported, and a signature that does not verify.
+ COSE —CBOR Object Signing and Encryption— transporta cargas útiles firmadas y cifradas en CBOR. Este
+ error abarca una estructura que no se ajusta a la forma de la especificación, un algoritmo no
+ admitido y una firma que no se verifica.

